## Layout

Clean Architecture packages under `src/{{ package_name }}/`:

- `domain/` — pure business concepts (no framework imports)
- `application/` — use cases{% if database %}; `ports.py` defines persistence ports{% endif %}
- `infrastructure/` — config{% if database %}, SQLAlchemy session, persistence adapters{% endif %}{% if is_mongodb or is_redis %}; NoSQL clients{% endif %}
- `presentation/` — Flask HTTP routes

Dependency rule: `presentation` → `application` → `domain`;
`infrastructure` implements ports and is wired at the edges.
